   "kind": "Term",
   "title": "Primer",
   "text": "The per-stack conventions document (primers/<template>/PRIMER.md) teaching an agent or developer the stack, architecture, and standards of one template. Root primers (PROCESS.md, CATALOGUE.md) hold the cross-stack process and catalogue rationale.",
   "source": "app/glossary.json",
   "durability": "durable-logic",
   "data": {
    "related": [
     "Template"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "term:size-class",
   "kind": "Term",
   "title": "Size class",
   "text": "A template's weight class: full (complete application platform with user auth and Docker Compose), micro (lightweight API-key service), or edge (Cloudflare-first, serverless).",
   "source": "app/glossary.json",
   "durability": "durable-logic",
   "data": {
    "aliases": [
     "full",
     "micro",
     "edge"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "term:template",
   "kind": "Term",
   "title": "Template",
   "text": "A production-ready starter repo (ConflictHQ/boilerworks-*) the CLI clones and renders into a new project. The catalogue of selectable templates lives in boilerworks/data/templates.yaml; each is pinned as a submodule under templates/.",
   "source": "app/glossary.json",
   "durability": "durable-logic",
   "data": {
    "related": [
     "Size class",
     "Primer"
